      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bivalve%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bivalve sits on Maryland’s Eastern Shore within Wicomico County, part of the Salisbury metropolitan area.",
